# Models trained locally and deliberately NOT committed.
# Part 5 shows two paths: model/variant_clf.joblib IS committed, to demonstrate
# git as the handoff boundary. Anything matching *_local.joblib goes straight
# from the laptop to the Model Registry instead, which is the everyday path.
# The registry is the artifact store; git is for code and definitions.
model/*_local.joblib
